ublic","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T14:03:34Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T14:32:07Z","body":"#106071 only uncovered a pre-existing bug. The create dialog keywords are implemented in a very dumb way. The whole \"Matches\" text is returned as type, you can test with\n```GDScript\nEditorInterface.popup_create_dialog(func(t): print(t), \"Node\")\n```\n(needs the revert linked above)\n\nInstead of trimming the suffix at source, the editor just filters it in various places\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7a228b4b9126d218425cb20b4846963b2dae489c/editor/scene/scene_create_dialog.cpp#L93\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7a228b4b9126d218425cb20b4846963b2dae489c/editor/script/script_create_dialog.cpp#L495\nbut not everywhere, so the bug had already existed, just wasn't uncovered before.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3607025538/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]